3.4 Feeding Programme
Proper nutrition was essential for rapid growth and efficient meat production.
The birds were fed according to age.
Age	Feed Type
0–8 weeks	Chick Mash
9–16 weeks	Growers Mash
Finishing period	Finisher Mash
Clean drinking water was continuously available.
Feed Management Practices
•	Feeders cleaned daily.
•	Feed wastage minimized.
•	Feed stored in a dry, well-ventilated store.
•	Spoilt feed discarded immediately.
